For this I think it would be simplest to remove the detections with missing observation covariates prior to feeding to formatMult:

> dat = dat[!is.na <http://is.na>(rowSums(dat[,c(9:16)])),]

(There are certainly more elegant ways to remove the missing values but this does work.)

